  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.3.0 - hierarchical focus (IFocusContainer, FocusScope), change events and disabled/read-only state across widgets, DataTable selection/sort/marking, command palette and key help, multi-series and stacked charts, cell-width-correct layout for CJK and emoji, 50 more ASCII-art fonts (134 total, including TAAG's Isometric1-4, Epic, Star Wars, and the TheDraw fonts FateGate and Bleach), and a FIGlet endmark fix for 14 built-in TOIlet fonts. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
